{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“常值单纯对象”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"常值单纯对象"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathsf C$ 上的常值"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯对象","text":"单纯对象"}},{"Plain":"是 $\\Delta^{\\text{op}}$ 到 $\\mathsf C$ 的常值函子, 也即复合函子 $\\underline{c} \\colon \\Delta^{\\text{op}} \\to \\{c\\} \\to\\mathsf C$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 常值单纯对象是 $\\operatorname{ev}_0 \\colon \\mathsf C^{\\Delta^{\\text{op}}} \\to\\mathsf C$ 的左"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":", 也即有自然同构\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf C^{\\Delta^{\\text{op}}}}(\\underline{c},X) \\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf C}(c,X_0).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>. 常值单纯对象的构造给出了 $\\mathsf C$ 到 $\\mathsf C^{\\Delta^{\\text{op}}}$ 的全忠实嵌入.</p>\n"}]}}